{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50826","headline":"泾川野居晚望 · 刘得仁","name":"泾川野居晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地极接穹苍，西维落太阳。\n泉声入深稻，山色出南岗。\n风起芦兼荻。\n烟生柘与桑，归来坐幽石，半壁冷蟾光。\n（见《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本第一册《天地山川类》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}